{"2924030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Overtime Heroes Exit 8", "steam_appid": 2924030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "The entire internet has been caught in a loop of ghostly walls, and now it's your turn.<br><br>You find yourself trapped in an endless cycle of overtime work, and your heart can barely take the strain.<br><br>The company! A byword for terrifying places. An endless stream of deadlines (ddl), and the constant emergence of scapegoats.<br><br>Carefully compare everything in the scene with your memories. If you find any discrepancies, turn back immediately! Perhaps then you can work a few less overtime hours.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924030/extras/112231382a1e1dedab46e02b4dd7f7b2.poster.avif?t=1715838863\" width=458 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924030/extras/112231382a1e1dedab46e02b4dd7f7b2.webm?t=1715838863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924030/extras/112231382a1e1dedab46e02b4dd7f7b2.mp4?t=1715838863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You must find the boss's office... Maybe you can grab him by the collar and threaten him to take you away from this dreadful place!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924030/extras/6a92e65cd362543f7c05ff645b439304.poster.avif?t=1715838863\" width=458 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924030/extras/6a92e65cd362543f7c05ff645b439304.webm?t=1715838863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924030/extras/6a92e65cd362543f7c05ff645b439304.mp4?t=1715838863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But things might not be as simple as they seem...<br><br>This game is a short walking simulation PC game that simulates the frantic rush of a corporate slave trying to get off work.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2> Meticulously observe the differences between the current floor and the reference floor. If there are no anomalies, proceed to take the elevator B; if anomalies are found, return to the elevator A. Strive to reach the floor where the boss's office is located and put an end to the curse of being unable to leave work.[/list]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Duration: </h2>Approximately 60-180 minutes.<br><br>Players take on the role of a corporate slave trapped in the cyclical floors of the company, searching for a way out. As you search through each floor, humor and scapegoats fly side by side.<br><br>Between laughter and tears, the corporate slaves may find a ray of sunlight at midnight.<br><br>The ending you witness might only be the tip of the iceberg of reality; only the true corporate slave, daring to go through multiple rounds of trials, can discover the answer to their fate.", "about_the_game": "The entire internet has been caught in a loop of ghostly walls, and now it's your turn.<br><br>You find yourself trapped in an endless cycle of overtime work, and your heart can barely take the strain.<br><br>The company! A byword for terrifying places. An endless stream of deadlines (ddl), and the constant emergence of scapegoats.<br><br>Carefully compare everything in the scene with your memories. If you find any discrepancies, turn back immediately! Perhaps then you can work a few less overtime hours.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924030/extras/112231382a1e1dedab46e02b4dd7f7b2.poster.avif?t=1715838863\" width=458 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.